ascetic: ["Living a strict, simple life", "Practicing self-denial", "Adjective or noun for people who give up comforts, often for spiritual reasons."],
austere: ["Plain and strict", "Severe and without luxury", "An adjective for strict lifestyles, rooms or personalities."],
